{
  "title": "Farewell Prayer of Ramazan",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّكَ قُلْتَ فِيْ كِتَابِكَ الْمُنْزَلِ شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ الَّذِيْۤ اُنْزِلَ فِيْهِ الْقُرْاٰنُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNAKA QULTA FEE KITAABIKAL MUNZALI SHAHRU RAMADAANAL LADHEE UNZILA FEEHIL QUR'AAN\nO Allah, You have said in Your revealed Book: “The month of Ramadan in which the Qur'an was revealed.”\nوَهٰذَا شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ وَقَدْ تَصَرَّمَ\nWA HAADHAA SHAHRU RAMADAANA WA QAD TASARRAM\nThis month of Ramadan is about to slip away.\nفَاَسْاَلُكَ بِوَجْهِكَ الْكَرِيْمِ وَكَلِمَاتِكَ التَّآمَّةِ\nFA-AS'ALUKA BIWAJHIKAL KAREEMI WA KALIMAATIKAT TAAMMAH\nI thus beseech You in the name of Your Noble Face and Your Perfect Words\nاِنْ كَانَ بَقِيَ عَلَيَّ ذَنْبٌ لَمْ تَغْفِرْهُ لِيْۤ اَوْ تُرِيْدُ اَنْ تُعَذِّبَنِيْ عَلَيْهِ اَوْ تُقَايِسَنِيْ بِهٖ\nIN KAANA BAQIYA A'LAYYA DHANBUN LAM TAGHFIRHU LEE AW TUREEDU AN TU'ADHDHIBANEE A'LAYHI AW TUQAAYISANEE BIH\nIf I am still liable to a sin that You have not forgiven yet, You want to punish me for it, or You want to retaliate upon me because of it\nاَنْ لَا يَطْلُعَ فَجْرُ هٰذِهِ اللَّيْلَةِ اَوْ يَتَصَرَّمَ هٰذَا الشَّهْرُ اِلَّا وَقَدْ غَفَرْتَهٗ لِيْ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nAN LAA YATLU'A FAJRU HAADHIHIL LAYLATI AW YATASARRAMA HAADHASH SHAHRU ILLAA WA QAD GHAFARTAHOO LEE YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\n(I beseech You that) before the dawn of this night rises and before this month elapses (please) forgive it for me, O most merciful of all those who show mercy!\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَكَ الْحَمْدُ بِمَحَامِدِكَ كُلِّهَا اَوَّلِهَا وَاٰخِرِهَا مَا قُلْتَ لِنَفْسِكَ مِنْهَا\nALLAAHUMMA LAKAL HAMDU BIMAHAAMIDIKA KULLIHAA AWWALIHAA WA AAKHIRIHAA MAA QULTA LINAFSIKA MINHAA\nO Allah, all praise be to You in all expressions of praise; both the first and the last expressions; expressions that You have said about Yourself and\nوَمَا قَالَ الْخَلَاۤئِقُ الْحَامِدُوْنَ الْمُجْتَهِدُوْنَ الْمَعْدُوْدُوْنَ الْمُوَقِّرُوْنَ ذِكْرَكَ وَالشُّكْرَ لَكَ\nWA MAA QAALAL KHALAA'IQUL HAAMIDOONAL MUJTAHIDOONAL MA'DOODOONAL MUWAQQIROONA DHIKRAKA WASH SHUKRA LAK\nexpressions that have been used by the created beings who praise You; the beings that are diligent, selected, revering their remembrance of You and their thanking You\nالَّذِيْنَ اَعَنْتَهُمْ عَلٰۤى اَدَاۤءِ حَقِّكَ\nALLADHEENA A'ANTAHUM A'LAA ADAA'I HAQQIK\nwhom You helped carry out Your duty that is incumbent upon them\nمِنْ اَصْنَافِ خَلْقِكَ مِنَ الْمَلَاۤئِكَةِ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ وَالنَّبِيِّيْنَ وَالْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَاَصْنَافِ النَّاطِقِيْنَ وَالْمُسَبِّحِيْنَ لَكَ مِنْ جَمِيْعِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nMIN ASNAAFI KHALQIKA MINAL MALAA'IKATIL MUQARRABEENA WAN NABIYYEENA WAL MURSALEENA WA ASNAAFIN NAATIQEENA WAL MUSABBIHEENA LAKA MIN JAMEE'IL A'ALAMEEN\nfrom among the varieties of Your creatures, such as the Archangels, the Prophets, the Messengers, and the other varieties who speak of Your praise and glorify You from among all the creatures.\nعَلٰۤى اَنَّكَ بَلَّغْتَنَا شَهْرَ رَمَضَانَ وَعَلَيْنَا مِنْ نِعَمِكَ وَعِنْدَنَا مِنْ قِسَمِكَ وَاِحْسَانِكَ وَتَظَاهُرِ امْتِنَانِكَ\nA'LAA ANNAKA BALLAGHTANAA SHAHRA RAMADAANA WA A'LAYNAA MIN NI'AMIKA WA I'NDANAA MIN QISAMIKA WA IHSAANIKA WA TAZAAHURIM TINAANIK\n(Praise be to You for) You have allowed us to witness the month of Ramadan while we are covered by Your graces and enjoying Your bounties, favors, and evident conferrals.\nفَبِذٰلِكَ لَكَ مُنْتَهَى الْحَمْدِ اَلْخَالِدُ الدَّاۤئِمُ الرَّاكِدُ الْمُخَلَّدُ السَّرْمَدِ اَلَّذِيْ لَا يَنْفَدُ طُوْلَ الْاَبَدِ\nFABIDHAALIKA LAKA MUNTAHAL HAMDIL KHAALIDUD DAA'IMUR RAAKIDUL MUKHALLADUS SARMADI ALLADHEE LAA YANFADU TOOLAL ABAD\nFor all that, ultimate praise be to You; such praise that is perpetual, ceaseless, endless, eternal, and everlasting; such praise that never ends evermore.\nجَلَّ ثَنَاۤؤُكَ اَعَنْتَنَا عَلَيْهِ حَتّٰى قَضَيْتَ عَنَّا صِيَامَهٗ وَقِيَامَهٗ\nJALLA THANAA'UKA A'ANTANAA A'LAYHI HATTAA QADAYTA A'NNAA SIYAAMAHOO WA QIYAAMAH\nSplendid be the praising of You, for You have helped us accomplish our fasting and acts of worship in this month\nمِنْ صَلَاةٍ وَمَا كَانَ مِنَّا فِيْهِ مِنْ بِرٍّ اَوْ شُكْرٍ اَوْ ذِكْرٍ\nMIN SALAATIN WA MAA KAANA MINNAA FEEHI MIN BIRRIN AW SHUKRIN AW DHIKR\nincluding prayers and whatever good deed that we have done during this month as well as all praise and mention of You.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَتَقَبَّلْهُ مِنَّا بِاَحْسَنِ قَبُوْلِكَ وَتَجَاوُزِكَ وَعَفْوِكَ وَصَفْحِكَ وَغُفْرَانِكَ وَحَقِيْقَةِ رِضْوَانِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA FATAQABBALHU MINNAA BI-AHSANI QABOOLIKA WA TAJAAWUZIKA WA A'FWIKA WA SAFHIKA WA GHUFRAANIKA WA HAQEEQATI RIDWAANIK\nO Allah, (please) accept all that from us with the most excellent of Your approval, Your overlooking, Your pardoning, Your excusing, Your forgiving, and the actuality of Your pleasure\nحَتّٰى تُظَفِّرَنَا فِيْهِ بِكُلِّ خَيْرٍ مَطْلُوْبٍ وَجَزِيْلِ عَطَاۤءٍ مَوْهُوْبٍ\nHATTAA TUZAFFIRANAA FEEHI BIKULLI KHAYRIN MATLOOBIN WA JAZEELI A'TAA'IN MAWHOOB\nso that You may make us win all good turns that is besought and the abundant share from any gifted bestowal\nوَتُوْقِيَنَا فِيْهِ مِنْ كُلِّ مَرْهُوْبٍ اَوْ بَلَاۤءٍ مَجْلُوْبٍ اَوْ ذَنْبٍ مَكْسُوْبٍ\nWA TOOQIYANAA FEEHI MIN KULLI MARHOOBIN AW BALAA'IN MAJLOOBIN AW DHANBIN MAKSOOB\nand You may save us from any dangerous matter, any anticipated misfortune, or any committed sin.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْاَلُكَ بِعَظِيْمِ مَا سَاَلَكَ بِهٖ اَحَدٌ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ مِنْ كَرِيْمِ اَسْمَاۤئِكَ وَجَمِيْلِ ثَنَاۤئِكَ وَخَآصَّةِ دُعَاۤئِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA BI-A'ZEEMI MAA SA'ALAKA BIHEE AHADUN MIN KHALQIKA MIN KAREEMI ASMAA'IKA WA JAMEELI THANAA'IKA WA KHAASSATI DU'AA'IK\nO Allah, I beseech You in the name of the greatest of all these by which any of Your servants have besought You, including Your Noble Names, the excellent praising of You, and the private supplication to You\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nto send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَ شَهْرَنَا هٰذَاۤ اَعْظَمَ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ مَرَّ عَلَيْنَا مُنْذُ اَنْزَلْتَنَا اِلَى الدُّنْيَا بَرَكَةً\nWA AN TAJ'ALA SHAHRANAA HAADHAA A'ZAMA SHAHRI RAMADAANA MARRA A'LAYNAA MUNDHU ANZALTANAA ILAD DUNYAA BARAKAH\ndecide this month of Ramadan to be the greatest month in blessings that we have ever witnessed since we were sent down to this world\nفِي عِصْمَةِ دِيْنِيْ وَخَلَاصِ نَفْسِيْ وَقَضَاۤءِ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ\nFEE I'SMATI DEENEE WA KHALAASI NAFSEE WA QADAA'I HAWAA'IJEE\nas regarding protection of my religion, redemption of myself, and settlement of my needs\nوَتُشَفِّعَنِيْ فِيْ مَسَاۤئِلِيْ وَتَمَامِ النِّعْمَةِ عَلَيَّ وَصَرْفِ السُّوْۤءِ عَنِّيْ وَلِبَاسِ الْعَافِيَةِ لِيْ فِيْهِ\nWA TUSHAFFI'ANEE FEE MASAA'ILEE WA TAMAAMIN NI'MATI A'LAYYA WA SARFIS SOO'I A'NNEE WA LIBAASIL A'AFIYATI LEE FEEH\nand to accept my intercession to You concerning Your settlement of my requests, perfecting Your graces upon me, keeping evil away from me, dressing me with wellbeing during this month\nوَاَنْ تَجْعَلَنِيْ بِرَحْمَتِكَ مِمَّنْ خِرْتَ لَهٗ لَيْلَةَ الْقَدْرِ وَجَعَلْتَهَا لَهٗ خَيْرًا مِنْ اَلْفِ شَهْرٍ\nWA AN TAJ'ALANEE BIRAHMATIKA MIMMAN KHIRTA LAHOO LAYLATAL QADRI WA JA'ALTAHAA LAHOO KHAYRAN MIN ALFI SHAHR\nand to include me, out of Your mercy, with those whom You allowed to obtain the benefits of the Grand Night and those for whom You have decided this Night to be better than one thousand months\nفِيْۤ اَعْظَمِ الْاَجْرِ وَكَرَاۤئِمِ الذُّخْرِ وَحُسْنِ الشُّكْرِ وَطُوْلِ الْعُمْرِ وَدَوَامِ الْيُسْرِ\nFEE A'ZAMIL AJRI WA KARAA'IMIDH DHUKHRI WA HUSNISH SHUKRI WA TOOLIL U'MRI WA DAWAAMIL YUSR\nas regarding obtaining its vastest rewards, its noblest gifts, approving of praiseworthiness, obtaining long lifetime, and perpetuity of comfort.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاَسْاَلُكَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ وَطَوْلِكَ وَعَفْوِكَ وَنَعْمَاۤئِكَ وَجَلَالِكَ وَقَدِيْمِ اِحْسَانِكَ وَامْتِنَانِكَ اَنْ لَا تَجْعَلَهٗ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنَّا لِشَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ\nALLAAHUMMA WA AS'ALUKA BIRAHMATIKA WA TAWLIKA WA A'FWIKA WA NA'MAA'IKA WA JALAALIKA WA QADEEMI IHSAANIKA WAMTINAANIKA AN LAA TAJ'ALAHOO AAKHIRAL A'HDI MINNAA LISHAHRI RAMADAAN\nO Allah, I also beseech You in the name of Your mercy, Your beneficence, Your pardon, Your graces, Your majesty, Your eternal favoring, and conferral not to decide this month of Ramadan to be the last one in our lifetime\nحَتّٰى تُبَلِّغَنَاهُ مِنْ قَابِلٍ عَلٰۤى اَحْسَنِ حَالٍ\nHATTAA TUBALLIGHANAAHU MIN QAABILIN A'LAA AHSANI HAAL\nrather, You may decide us to catch the coming month of Ramadan while we enjoy the best of manners\nوَتُعَرِّفَنِيْ هِلَالَهٗ مَعَ النَّاظِرِيْنَ اِلَيْهِ وَالْمُعْتَرِفِيْنَ لَهٗ فِيْۤ اَعْفٰى عَافِيَتِكَ وَاَنْعَمِ نِعْمَتِكَ وَاَوْسَعِ رَحْمَتِكَ وَاَجْزَلِ قِسَمِكَ\nWA TU'ARRIFANEE HILAALAHOO MA'AN NAAZIREENA ILAYHI WAL MU'TARIFEENA LAHOO FEE A'FAA A'AFIYATIKA WA AN'AMI NI'MATIKA WA AWSA'I RAHMATIKA WA AJZALI QISAMIK\nand to decide me to see the new moon of the next month of Ramadan by including me with those who will see it and realize its value while enjoying the best wellbeing, the most blissful of Your bounties, the most expansive of Your mercy, and the most abundant of the share of Your sustenance that You decide for me.\nيَا رَبِّيَ الَّذِيْ لَيْسَ لِيْ رَبٌّ غَيْرُهٗ\nYAA RABBIYAL LADHEE LAYSA LEE RABBUN GHAYRUH\nO my Lord save Whom I have no lord!\nلَا يَكُوْنُ هٰذَا الْوَدَاعُ مِنِّيْ لَهٗ وَدَاعَ فَنَاۤءٍ وَلَاۤ اٰخِرَ الْعَهْدِ مِنِّيْ لِلِقَاۤءٍ\nLAA YAKOONU HAADHAL WADAA'U MINNEE LAHOO WADAA'A FANAA'IN WA LAA AAKHIRAL A'HDI MINNEE LILIQAA'\n(Please) do not decide these words of bidding farewell to the month of Ramadan to be the last farewell after which there will be my termination and do not decide this time to be the last of my meeting the month of Ramadan\nحَتّٰى تُرِيَنِيْهِ مِنْ قَابِلٍ فِيْۤ اَوْسَعِ النِّعَمِ وَاَفْضَلِ الرَّجَاۤءِ وَاَنَا لَكَ عَلٰۤى اَحْسَنِ الْوَفَاۤءِ\nHATTAA TURIYANEEHI MIN QAABILIN FEE AWSA'IN NI'AMI WA AFDALIR RAJAA'I WA ANAA LAKA A'LAA AHSANIL WAFAA'\nrather, You may decide that You will enable me to witness the coming Ramadan while enjoying the most expansive graces and attaining the best of my hopes, being loyal to You in the most faithful manner.\nاِنَّكَ سَمِيْعُ الدُّعَاۤءِ\nINNAKA SAMEE'UD DU'AA'\nVerily, You are the Hearer of prayers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اسْمَعْ دُعَاۤئِيْ وَارْحَمْ تَضَرُّعِيْ وَتَذَلُّلِيْ لَكَ وَاسْتِكَانَتِيْ وَتَوَكُّلِيْ عَلَيْكَ وَاَنَا لَكَ مُسَلِّمٌ\nALLAAHUMMAS MA' DU'AA'EE WARHAM TADARRU'EE WA TADHALLULEE LAKA WASTIKAANATEE WA TAWAKKULEE A'LAYKA WA ANAA LAKA MUSALLIM\nO Allah, (please) respond to my prayer and have mercy upon my acquiescence, submission before You, humbleness, and reliance upon You, while I am totally subservient to You.\nلَاۤ اَرْجُوْ نَجَاحًا وَلَا مُعَافَاةً وَلَا تَشْرِيْفًا وَلَا تَبْلِيْغًا اِلَّا بِكَ وَمِنْكَ\nLAA ARJOO NAJAAHAN WA LAA MU'AAFAATAN WA LAA TASHREEFAN WA LAA TABLEEGHAN ILLAA BIKA WA MINK\nI hope success, wellbeing, honoring, and achievements of my wishes from none save You and through none save You.\nوَامْنُنْ عَلَيَّ جَلَّ ثَنَاۤؤُكَ وَتَقَدَّسَتْ اَسْمَاۤؤُكَ\nWAMNUN A'LAYYA JALLA THANAA'UKA WA TAQADDASAT ASMAA'UK\nSo, (please) do this favor to me. Splendid be the praising of You and sacred be Your Names.\nبِتَبْلِيْغِيْ شَهْرَ رَمَضَانَ وَاَنَا مُعَافًى مِنْ كُلِّ مَكْرُوْهٍ وَمَحْذُوْرٍ وَمِنْ جَمِيْعِ الْبَوَاۤئِقِ\nBITABLEEGHEE SHAHRA RAMADAANA WA ANAA MU'AAFAN MIN KULLI MAKROOHIN WA MAHDHOORIN WA MIN JAMEE'IL BAWAA'IQ\nBy allowing me to witness the (coming) month of Ramadan, please deliver me from any apprehensive and fearful matter and from all misfortunes.\nالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْۤ اَعَانَنَا عَلٰى صِيَامِ هٰذَا الشَّهْرِ وَقِيَامِهٖ حَتّٰى بَلَّغَنِيْۤ اٰخِرَ لَيْلَةٍ مِنْهُ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE A'AANANAA A'LAA SIYAAMI HAADHASH SHAHRI WA QIYAAMIHEE HATTAA BALLAGHANEE AAKHIRA LAYLATIN MINH\nAll praise be to Allah Who has helped us observe fasting during this month and do acts of worship; so, I am witnessing the last night of this month.",
  "merits": "Shaykh al-Kulayni, may Allah be pleased with him, in his book of al-Kafi, has reported on the authority of Abu-Basir that Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) instructed that this supplicatory prayer might be said for bidding farewell to the month of Ramazan."
